## 1. Executive Summary & Core Concept

**StockPulse** is a full-featured, zero-risk financial paper-trading simulator designed to replicate real-world stock market trading. 

* **Virtual Capital:** Every user begins with a virtual balance (default ₹100,000 / $10,000).
* **Real-time Live Market Data:** Stock quotes, market prices, and historical records are streamed directly from Yahoo Finance via a specialized Python bridge (`yfinance`).
* **Zero Financial Risk:** No real brokers or actual funds are involved. Orders are executed virtually against live market prices.
* **Automated Safety Protection:** A continuous background daemon monitors open positions against user-defined stop-loss prices, automatically triggering simulated market-sell orders when downside risk thresholds are breached.

---

## 2. End-to-End Ecosystem Architecture

The application is structured into four cooperative tiers:

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                          1. Client Layer (Browser)                     │
│  - Responsive UI (Vanilla JS, CSS3, Google Fonts)                      │
│  - Interactive Price & Indicator Charts (Chart.js)                     │
│  - Real-time Status Badges (Stop-Loss Heartbeat, P&L Color Codes)     │
└───────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘
                                    │ HTTP / HTTPS (GET / POST / AJAX)
                                    ▼
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                          2. Application Layer (PHP 8.0+)               │
│  - Session Management & Route Authentication (`auth_check`)            │
│  - Order Execution Engine (`execute_buy_stock`, `execute_sell_stock`)   │
│  - Portfolio Math (Floating P&L, Realised P&L, Weighted Cost Basis)    │
│  - JSON REST Endpoints (`/api/stock_price.php`, `/api/stock_analysis`) │
└───────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────┘
                    │ PDO Transactions                 │ Subprocess IPC
                    ▼                                  ▼
┌───────────────────────────────────┐  ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
│     3. Data Persistence Layer     │  │   4. Market Intelligence Layer  │
│ - PostgreSQL (Primary Engine)     │  │ - Python 3.12 (`stock_data.py`) │
│ - SQLite (Automatic Fallback)     │  │ - `yfinance` Market Fetcher     │
│ - Tables: `users`, `accounts`,    │  │ - Background Monitor Daemon     │
│   `positions`, `trades`,          │  │   (`monitor_stop_loss.py`)      │
│   `price_cache`, `monitor_status` │  │ - Yahoo Finance Cloud API       │
└───────────────────────────────────┘  └─────────────────────────────────┘
```

