## 3. Complete User Journey & Lifecycle Flowchart

The following flowchart outlines the entire lifecycle of a user interacting with the platform from entry to exit:

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([User Opens Browser]) --> AuthCheck{Is Session Authenticated?}
    
    %% Authentication & Onboarding
    AuthCheck -- No --> LoginPage[Display Login Page /login.php]
    LoginPage --> HasAccount{Existing Account?}
    HasAccount -- No --> RegisterPage[Register / Create Account]
    RegisterPage --> HashPassword[Hash Password bcrypt/argon2]
    HashPassword --> InitAccount[Provision ₹100,000 Virtual Balance]
    InitAccount --> LoginPage
    HasAccount -- Yes --> SubmitLogin[Submit Email & Password]
    SubmitLogin --> VerifyCreds{Credentials Valid?}
    VerifyCreds -- No --> LoginError[Show Error Flash Message] --> LoginPage
    VerifyCreds -- Yes --> CreateSession[Generate Secure Session ID & Token]
    CreateSession --> RedirectDash[Redirect to Dashboard index.php]
    
    %% Authenticated App Flow
    AuthCheck -- Yes --> Dashboard[Dashboard index.php]
    RedirectDash --> Dashboard
    
    Dashboard --> NavChoice{User Navigation Choice}
    
    %% Navigation Paths
    NavChoice -->|1. Research Stocks| Analysis[Stock Analysis Page stock_analysis.php]
    NavChoice -->|2. Place New Order| BuyPage[Buy Stocks Page buy.php]
    NavChoice -->|3. View Open Holdings| PortfolioPage[Portfolio Page portfolio.php]
    NavChoice -->|4. Audit Transactions| TradeHistory[Trade History trade_history.php]
    NavChoice -->|5. Reset Simulator| ResetBalance[Reset Virtual Capital Action]
    NavChoice -->|6. Terminate Session| LogoutAction[Logout Action /logout.php]
    
    %% Analysis Flow
    Analysis --> InputTicker[Input Stock Symbol e.g., RELIANCE.NS, AAPL]
    InputTicker --> PyAnalysis[Python computes RSI, MACD, SMA, Valuation]
    PyAnalysis --> RenderCharts[Render Interactive Chart.js & Trade Verdict]
    RenderCharts --> QuickBuy[Click 'Quick Buy' Button] --> BuyPage
    
    %% Buy Flow
    BuyPage --> FetchLiveQuote[Fetch Live Yahoo Finance Price via API]
    FetchLiveQuote --> ConfigureOrder[Enter Quantity + Optional Stop-Loss]
    ConfigureOrder --> CashCheck{Available Cash >= Total Cost?}
    CashCheck -- No --> RejectBuy[Display Insufficient Funds Notice]
    CashCheck -- Yes --> DeductCash[Deduct Cash & Insert/Update Position]
    DeductCash --> LogBuyTrade[Write BUY Entry to Trade Ledger]
    LogBuyTrade --> PortfolioPage
    
    %% Portfolio & Sell Flow
    PortfolioPage --> UpdateSL[Edit Stop-Loss Price / Percentage]
    PortfolioPage --> SellAction[Click Sell Stock]
    SellAction --> SellPage[Sell Stocks Page sell.php]
    SellPage --> CheckQty{Quantity Held >= Sell Qty?}
    CheckQty -- No --> RejectSell[Display Invalid Quantity Error]
    CheckQty -- Yes --> CalcPnL[Calculate Realised Profit/Loss]
    CalcPnL --> CreditCash[Credit Proceeds to Virtual Balance]
    CreditCash --> LogSellTrade[Write SELL Entry to Trade Ledger]
    LogSellTrade --> TradeHistory
    
    %% Background Stop-Loss Daemon
    subgraph Background_Monitoring_Daemon [24/7 Automated Stop-Loss Engine]
        DaemonRun[monitor_stop_loss.py Running] --> PollPositions[Fetch Open Positions with Stop-Loss]
        PollPositions --> QueryYF[Query Live Yahoo Finance Prices]
        QueryYF --> SLTriggered{Live Price <= Stop-Loss Price?}
        SLTriggered -- Yes --> AutoSellAPI[Call api/execute_stop_loss.php]
        AutoSellAPI --> Liquidate[Execute Market Sell & Credit Virtual Balance]
        Liquidate --> LogSLTrade[Write STOP_LOSS_TRIGGERED to Ledger]
        SLTriggered -- No --> SleepInterval[Sleep 30 Seconds] --> PollPositions
    end
    
    %% Logout Flow
    LogoutAction --> ClearSession[Destroy Session Data & Expire Cookie]
    ClearSession --> RedirectLogin[Redirect to login.php with Flash Confirmation]
    RedirectLogin --> End([User Logged Out Safely])
```

